sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor M as 200 名管理员
  participant N as Nginx
  participant I as AuthorizationInterceptor
  participant A as AuthorizationService
  participant C as PermissionCache
  participant DB as MySQL
  participant U as UserAppService
  loop 并发列表 / 筛选 / 翻页
    M->>N: GET /users?dept=...&page=...
    N->>I: 转发请求
    I->>A: 会话身份 + operationId
    A->>DB: 读取当前 authz_version（主库）
    DB-->>A: version
    A->>C: get(userId + appCode + version)
    alt 缓存命中
      C-->>A: 有效权限 + 范围
    else 缓存未命中
      A->>DB: 加载用户角色、角色授权、继承闭包
      DB-->>A: 授权数据
      A->>A: EffectivePermissionCalculator
      A->>C: put(key, 权限)
    end
    A->>A: ApiPermissionResolver → rbac:user:read
    A-->>I: 允许
    I->>U: 执行列表查询
    U->>DB: 范围裁剪 + 索引 + 分页
    DB-->>U: 分页结果
    U-->>N: 200 items / total
    N-->>M: 200
  end
  Note over A,C: 目标：P95 鉴权 ≤10ms；列表 ≤1s；错误率 <0.1%
